a ramp car game\n- Authentic sound effects enhancing the racing car game experience\n- Exciting car games simulator challenges with a focus on thrilling stunts\n- Perform daring stunts in the mega ramp racing game\n- Engaging and challenging levels", "short_description": "Dive into the electrifying realm of high-octane stunts with Examob Games' car sunt extreme an adrenaline-packed mega ramp car adventure. Brace yourself for the ultimate driving challenge as precision and skill become your trusted companions, navigating through intricate tracks that redefine the boundaries of excitement."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/noob-gamers/privacy-policy/meta-quest-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Examob", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/noob-gamers/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "28035021339478915"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 10, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "970379698809321"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1239868288254687"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1446613507096555"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1718730692433562"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "825917447103027"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "500916853116483"}, {"status"